sses the  demons the heroes and the sword itself  are all tied to the cycle because demise  isn't  dead but since demise has been sealed  away and nobody can really touch him  how could we possibly stop the cycle  that he's continually fueling  allow me to answer this question with  another question how do you stop a river  from flowing or an  arrow from flying or a bloodline from  continuing  okay that last one was pretty dark  granted but in each scenario  you go to the source and cut it off in  this case  to stop demise's power from seeping into  the world over and over again  what if his prison the master sword has  to be destroyed while he's inside  the way i see it this could go one of  two ways one if the master sword was  broken  it could release demise into the world  which would now exist without the master  sword  that would be a bummer but two the  master sword could destroy the souls  that live inside it  fee and demise freeing the world from  the hateful cycle once and for all  now i'm not saying that this is  something i expect to happen in a future  game or even that i want to see  happen because i kind of really like the  master sword this is all  completely a what-if kind of scenario  like i mentioned earlier on in the video  but doesn't it kinda make sense if  demise is still alive within the master  sword that makes sense as to why hylia  created it to seal him in the first  place as he was initially her  enemy and it also makes sense as to why  the master sword is the only weapon  capable of defeating demise's evil  creations but if link could use the  master sword to defeat the current  incarnation of demise and then destroy  the sword  what if that is what it would take to  end the cycle  once and for all and that is my theory  on how to end the cycle of hatred that  governs the legend of zelda did you  enjoy the video  if so please leave a like and comment  below what your aha  moment was or if you think i missed  something or you know if you